# PC card team-portfolio (BENCH-231): the confirm, arm c@J@ (@J@ = bb, the A/A, or fx, the tmtab build of the picked table) on the picked teams, 24 seeds from 15100, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @J@ = bb or fx.
--team
true
--seeds
24
--seed-base
15100
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-portfolio-confirm.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@@J@.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@@J@
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-portfolio-@V@-c@J@
